    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks but it doesn't really feel like i can \"occupy myself\" with anything. it just feels like i'm pretending to be alive while waiting for the clock to run out. it feels like the only thing he ever gave me was a reason to want to be here, and now that he's gone, there's actually nothing left. just this big, empty nothingness.",
