      "content": "it's hard to find a way out when the whole world just feels like it's built on nothing. i look around and i don't see any reason to keep doing this cycle of waking up and feeling this ache. it honestly feels like the most honest thing i could do is just stop fighting it. if there's no meaning left, why is it so wrong to just let go?",
